<p>Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Hogaya ranj o alam se shaq jigar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

<p>1. Saath paani ke labe darya baha khoone jar<br />
tukde tukde kardiya zalim ne sar Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

<p>2. kehti thi baali Sakina(s.a) phir na zindaa'n ka ho gham<br />
zikr gar sunti rahu'n shaam o sahar Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

<p>3. Khoon ki bhi naher ek reti pa jaari hogayi<br />
Ek baazu kat gaya jab naher par Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

<p>4. Shah ke rone ki sada sunkar yeh Zainab(s.a) ne kaha<br />
hogaya shaayad zamaane se safar Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

<p>5. Ek ba ek Aakar laga mashke sakina(s.a) par jo teer<br />
Saath pani ke baha khoone jigar Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

<p>6. Le rahi thi shouq se kar gaam par bose zamee'n<br />
Ho raha tha farqe anwar khoo'n se tar Abbas(a.s) ka<br />
Jab hua farqe mubarak khoo'n me tar Abbas(a.s) ka</p>

